but he was taking a cut.

993
01:01:59,049 --> 01:02:03,009
Now, what if Dave Peters was serious
about shutting down Matt Greenwood?

994
01:02:03,153 --> 01:02:04,746
And what if he
went to the mayor?

995
01:02:04,888 --> 01:02:08,381
And what if, figuring that the police
chief was somehow involved in it,

996
01:02:08,525 --> 01:02:10,824
he and the mayor started
their own private investigation?

997
01:02:10,961 --> 01:02:13,105
That would explain why they
were together that afternoon.

998
01:02:13,129 --> 01:02:14,461
Yeah.

999
01:02:14,598 --> 01:02:18,501
And why Jay Reynolds
was told to kill both of them.

1000
01:02:18,635 --> 01:02:21,036
And why Matt Greenwood made sure

1001
01:02:21,171 --> 01:02:23,663
that Jay Reynolds was
caught and took the whole rap.

1002
01:02:23,807 --> 01:02:25,241
Uh-huh.

1003
01:02:25,375 --> 01:02:27,105
Leigh Anne should
be told about this.

1004
01:02:27,244 --> 01:02:28,303
Yeah.

1005
01:02:28,445 --> 01:02:30,676
Yeah. She's in court.

1006
01:02:32,382 --> 01:02:36,080
But if you hurry, you can catch
them before she breaks for lunch.

1007
01:02:36,219 --> 01:02:38,188
- I should tell her?
- Yeah.

1008
01:02:38,321 --> 01:02:39,345
<i>Yeah, yeah, yeah.</i>

1009
01:02:39,489 --> 01:02:44,189
<i>And listen, if she decides to go talk
to Matt Greenwood, you go with her.</i>

1010
01:02:52,969 --> 01:02:57,270
Lieutenant, what did the
forensic lab report indicate

1011
01:02:57,407 --> 01:03:00,605
was found inside the cup
by the decedent's bed?

1012
01:03:00,744 --> 01:03:03,976
A commercial blend of black
tea and a form of cyanide

1013
01:03:04,114 --> 01:03:07,209
more or less commonly
sold in jewelry supply stores.

1014
01:03:07,350 --> 01:03:10,320
And according to the lab
report, what was on the cup?

1015
01:03:10,453 --> 01:03:13,787
Traces of lipstick
identical to the lipstick

1016
01:03:13,923 --> 01:03:16,154
Eva Brodsky was wearing
at the time of her death,

1017
01:03:16,293 --> 01:03:19,058
one or two fingerprints
belonging to her,

1018
01:03:19,195 --> 01:03:21,960
and several others belonging
to the defendant, Arthur Eller.

1019
01:03:22,098 --> 01:03:25,159
When the defendant,
Mr. Eller, was arrested,

1020
01:03:25,302 --> 01:03:27,134
a search was made of his home.

1021
01:03:27,270 --> 01:03:29,466
Please tell the
court what you found.

1022
01:03:29,606 --> 01:03:33,668
A container of cyanide
crystal identical in formulation

1023
01:03:33,810 --> 01:03:37,247
to the cyanide found in the cup was
removed from beneath his kitchen sink.

1024
01:03:37,380 --> 01:03:39,372
Thank you, Lieutenant.

1025
01:03:39,516 --> 01:03:41,644
Your witness, counselor.

1026
01:03:43,987 --> 01:03:47,355
You say the cyanide you found
is sold in jewelry supply stores.

1027
01:03:47,490 --> 01:03:51,120
That's correct. It's used in
the process of silver-plating.

1028
01:03:51,261 --> 01:03:55,164
And your detectives canvassed all
the jewelry supply stores in the area

1029
01:03:55,298 --> 01:03:58,791
to see if anyone remembered selling
that cyanide to my client, did they not?

1030
01:03:58,935 --> 01:04:00,369
Yes, they did.

1031
01:04:00,503 --> 01:04:02,734
Had anyone sold it to my client?

1032
01:04:02,872 --> 01:04:05,637
Not that we could find. No.

1033
01:04:05,775 --> 01:04:07,243
Thank you.

1034
01:04:07,377 --> 01:04:09,005
The witness may step down.

1035
01:04:09,145 --> 01:04:14,743
We'll break for lunch, and then you
can call your next witness, Miss March.

1036
01:04:14,884 --> 01:04:17,945
This court is in
recess until 2 p.m.

1037
01:04:23,026 --> 01:04:24,961
- Hi.
- Hi.

1038
01:04:25,095 --> 01:04:26,757
I have to talk to you
about something.

1039
01:04:40,176 --> 01:04:42,543
A pornography ring
involving the chief of police.

1040
01:04:42,679 --> 01:04:43,806
That explains a lot.

1041
01:04:43,947 --> 01:04:45,279
Thanks, Conrad.

1042
01:04:45,415 --> 01:04:47,213
Did you know you're
a lot like your dad?

1043
01:04:47,350 --> 01:04:49,114
- You think so?
- Oh, yeah. I think...

1044
01:04:49,252 --> 01:04:50,345
There's Matt Greenwood.

1045
01:04:50,487 --> 01:04:51,750
Hey, Mr. Greenwood!

1046
01:04:51,888 --> 01:04:53,584
Wait up a sec.

1047
01:05:17,013 --> 01:05:18,948
Why are you
knocking? It's not locked.

1048
01:05:19,082 --> 01:05:20,659
I know, but could you
come outside for a second?

1049
01:05:20,683 --> 01:05:21,844
I'm reading.

1050
01:05:21,985 --> 01:05:23,385
Ben, it's your begonias.

1051
01:05:23,520 --> 01:05:25,512
I think Ralph Terwilliger's
dog is in them again.

1052
01:05:25,655 --> 01:05:28,147
If I ever get my
hands on that dog...

1053
01:05:37,901 --> 01:05:40,063
My begonias look fine.

1054
01:05:41,471 --> 01:05:42,996
- Hi.
- Hi.

1055
01:05:43,139 --> 01:05:45,040
- We had to get you out of the house.
- Why?

1056
01:05:45,175 --> 01:05:47,076
- We're pretty sure it's bugged.
- Bugged?

1057
01:05:47,210 --> 01:05:48,769
Your house and your phone.

1058
01:05:48,912 --> 01:05:51,814
Somebody put microphones
in my house? Are you sure?

1059
01:05:51,948 --> 01:05:52,948
It has to be.

1060
01:05:53,082 --> 01:05:55,950
Ben, we talk about Cari
Phillips in your kitchen,

1061
01:05:56,085 --> 01:05:58,611
and when we go looking
for her, she's left the country.

1062
01:05:58,755 --> 01:06:02,658
Then we talk about Matt Greenwood in
your living room, and he gets murdered.

1063
01:06:02,792 --> 01:06:04,624
Matt Greenwood's dead?

1064
01:06:04,761 --> 01:06:06,772
Somebody drove by and
shot him right in front of us.

1065
01:06:06,796 --> 01:06:10,699
If this thing is as big as we think it is,
bugging your house would not be a problem.

1066
01:06:10,834 --> 01:06:14,430
For the time being, I think
it's best not to let on you know.

1067
01:06:15,605 --> 01:06:16,605
You have an idea?

1068
01:06:16,739 --> 01:06:19,265
Yeah, I do.

1069
01:06:23,880 --> 01:06:26,008
Have Sergeant
Robbins get right on it.

1070
01:06:31,321 --> 01:06:32,721
Colin, can I talk
to you a minute?

1071
01:06:32,856 --> 01:06:35,257
Yes, of course.

1072
01:06:38,461 --> 01:06:40,794
- How are you doing, Bob?
- Fine. Fine.

1073
01:06:40,930 --> 01:06:43,866
Leigh Anne Mclntyre, this
is Police Chief Colin Young.

1074
01:06:44,000 --> 01:06:45,559
- How do you do?
- How do you do?

1075
01:06:45,702 --> 01:06:47,603
Mrs. Mclntyre is
defending Arthur Eller.

1076
01:06:47,737 --> 01:06:50,935
Oh, yes. Of course.

1077
01:06:51,074 --> 01:06:52,565
Shouldn't you be in court?

1078
01:06:52,709 --> 01:06:54,678
- We just recessed for the day.
- Oh.

1079
01:06:54,811 --> 01:06:58,213
Colin, I have to ask
you a few questions.

1080
01:06:58,348 --> 01:06:59,348
About what?

1081
01:06:59,415 --> 01:07:01,160
What was your relationship
to Matt Greenwood?

1082
01:07:01,184 --> 01:07:02,550
Matt Greenwood?

1083
01:07:02,685 --> 01:07:04,347
The man who was
killed this afternoon.

1084
01:07:04,487 --> 01:07:05,716
Yeah, I know who he is.

1085
01:07:05,855 --> 01:07:06,914
What I don't understand

1086
01:07:07,056 --> 01:07:09,001
is why you think I had some
kind of relationship with him

1087
01:07:09,025 --> 01:07:10,550
and why you're
asking me questions.

1088
01:07:10,693 --> 01:07:12,189
Because you were
seen talking to him a

1089
01:07:12,213 --> 01:07:13,973
little more than an
hour before he was shot.

1090
01:07:15,131 --> 01:07:19,227
Bob, I want to know why you're
asking me these questions.

1091
01:07:19,369 --> 01:07:22,498
I'm still investigating the
murder of Mayor Jeffries,

1092
01:07:22,639 --> 01:07:25,017
and I want to know what you were
doing with Matt Greenwood today.

1093
01:07:25,041 --> 01:07:26,100
My job.

1094
01:07:26,242 --> 01:07:28,404
That videotape we found
of the mayor's assassination,

1095
01:07:28,545 --> 01:07:30,138
Matt Greenwood was in it.

1096
01:07:30,280 --> 01:07:32,647
He's the one who more or
less nailed the shooter for us.

1097
01:07:32,782 --> 01:07:36,344
When we ID'd him, I paid him a
visit and asked him a few questions.

1098
01:07:36,486 --> 01:07:37,784
What did he say?

1099
01:07:37,921 --> 01:07:39,719
I don't think I'm
obligated to answer that.

1100
01:07:39,856 --> 01:07:42,223
In fact, if you don't mind,
I'd like to get back to work.

1101
01:07:42,358 --> 01:07:43,519
Oh, just one more question.

1102
01:07:43,660 --> 01:07:46,152
Where were you on the night
that Eva Brodsky was murdered?

1103
01:07:46,296 --> 01:07:48,288
Now what the hell do
you want to know that for?

1104
01:07:48,431 --> 01:07:49,626
Well, because I'm convinced

1105
01:07:49,766 --> 01:07:52,047
that the mayor's death and her
death are somehow connected

1106
01:07:52,135 --> 01:07:53,728
and that you're the
common denominator.

1107
01:07:57,373 --> 01:07:58,932
That's ridiculous.

1108
01:07:59,075 --> 01:08:02,739
Colin, just tell us where you were
on the 19th, and we'll be on our way.

1109
01:08:08,585 --> 01:08:09,678
All right.

1110
01:08:11,287 --> 01:08:13,756
Ah. On the 19th, I
had a meeting at 5,

1111
01:08:13,890 --> 01:08:15,984
which probably means I
got back here around 6.

1112
01:08:16,125 --> 01:08:18,924
Then, as I recall, I sat here and
worked, caught the evening news,

1113
01:08:19,062 --> 01:08:23,363
got home around 7:30, ate a frozen
dinner, read, and went to bed at 10.

1114
01:08:23,499 --> 01:08:24,933
You happy?

1115
01:08:35,778 --> 01:08:36,778
He's lying.

1116
01:08:36,846 --> 01:08:38,678
He met Matt Greenwood
more than once.

1117
01:08:38,815 --> 01:08:41,182
You know, he could even be
behind the shooting of Greenwood.

1118
01:08:41,317 --> 01:08:43,684
If we could find somebody
at Salvatore Productions

1119
01:08:43,820 --> 01:08:46,346
that saw him and Greenwood
together before yesterday,

1120
01:08:46,489 --> 01:08:50,324
you can bet that police chief is
going to be in a whole lot of trouble.

1121
01:08:52,595 --> 01:08:56,259
You live right across the street from
where Eva Brodsky lived with her husband.

1122
01:08:56,399 --> 01:08:58,129
Is that correct,
Mr. Bartholomew?

1123
01:08:58,267 --> 01:08:59,701
That's right. Yes.

1124
01:08:59,836 --> 01:09:01,896
And where were you on
the afternoon she died?

1125
01:09:02,038 --> 01:09:03,165
Do you remember?

1126
01:09:03,306 --> 01:09:06,037
I was outside in my
driveway working on my car.

1127
01:09:06,175 --> 01:09:08,235
Uh-huh. And while
you were outside,

1128
01:09:08,378 --> 01:09:11,871
did you happen to see anyone
enter or leave the Brodsky home?

1129
01:09:12,015 --> 01:09:13,313
Yes.

1130
01:09:13,449 --> 01:09:17,318
Around 5, I saw that
man right there go inside.

1131
01:09:17,453 --> 01:09:19,445
He came out about
an hour or so later.

1132
01:09:19,589 --> 01:09:22,957
Let the record show the
witness pointed at the defendant.

1133
01:09:23,092 --> 01:09:25,186
Are you sure he's
the man you saw?

1134
01:09:25,328 --> 01:09:27,627
Positive. I used to
see him there a lot.

1135
01:09:27,764 --> 01:09:29,733
Thank you. Nothing further.

1136
01:09:29,866 --> 01:09:31,459
Your witness.

1137
01:09:35,271 --> 01:09:38,241
How long were you out there
working on your car that day?

1138
01:09:38,374 --> 01:09:40,104
From about 4 till it got dark.

1139
01:09:40,243 --> 01:09:42,007
That's a long time.

1140
01:09:42,145 --> 01:09:46,048
It's a classic, see... A
'54 Chevy convertible.

1141
01:09:46,182 --> 01:09:48,193
I was getting her cleaned
up for a rally that weekend.

1142
01:09:48,217 --> 01:09:50,049
Oh.

1143
01:09:50,186 --> 01:09:54,851
Tell me this, Mr. Bartholomew, did
you see anyone else in this courtroom

1144
01:09:54,991 --> 01:09:56,926
at Eva Brodsky's
home that evening?

1145
01:09:57,060 --> 01:10:00,224
Yeah. I saw him.

1146
01:10:03,466 --> 01:10:07,961
Let the record show the witness
pointed to Police Chief Colin Young.

1147
01:10:10,740 --> 01:10:13,369
Any idea what time you saw him?

1148
01:10:13,509 --> 01:10:17,378
About 15 minutes or
so after Judge Eller left.

1149
01:10:17,513 --> 01:10:18,811
Thank you.

1150
01:10:21,284 --> 01:10:22,980
Prosecution?

1151
01:10:24,821 --> 01:10:27,552
Uh, prosecution
rests, Your Honor.

1152
01:10:27,690 --> 01:10:29,318
The witness is excused.

1153
01:10:29,459 --> 01:10:32,395
Is the defense ready
to present its case?

1154
01:10:33,663 --> 01:10:35,564
Yes, Your Honor.
For my first witness,

1155
01:10:35,698 --> 01:10:38,327
please call Police Chief
Colin Young to the stand.

1156
01:10:45,775 --> 01:10:48,677
Would you tell the court
who Matt Greenwood is?

1157
01:10:48,811 --> 01:10:53,909
Matt Greenwood is, or was, a
producer of pornographic films.

1158
01:10:54,050 --> 01:10:57,043
He died recently.

1159
01:10:57,186 --> 01:10:59,712
In point of fact, he was
murdered, was he not?

1160
01:10:59,856 --> 01:11:00,915
Yes.

1161
01:11:01,057 --> 01:11:03,686
And this man...
this pornographer...

1162
01:11:03,826 --> 01:11:07,593
Also happened to assist the
police in capturing Mr. Jay Reynolds

1163
01:11:07,730 --> 01:11:09,041
in the minutes
after Mr. Reynolds

1164
01:11:09,065 --> 01:11:12,558
had just assassinated Mayor
Jeffries and Dave Peters, didn't he?

1165
01:11:12,702 --> 01:11:14,136
Ironically, yes, he did.

1166
01:11:14,270 --> 01:11:17,516
About the only contact I had with him was
when I questioned him on just that matter.

1167
01:11:17,540 --> 01:11:19,702
- Objection.
- Move to strike that answer, Your Honor.

1168
01:11:19,842 --> 01:11:21,602
We fail to see relevancy
to these questions.

1169
01:11:21,711 --> 01:11:23,179
Please bear with me, Your Honor.

1170
01:11:23,312 --> 01:11:25,838
This line of questioning
is crucial to my defense.

1171
01:11:25,982 --> 01:11:28,042
Get to the point
and be quick about it.

1172
01:11:28,184 --> 01:11:29,379
Overruled.

1173
01:11:29,519 --> 01:11:31,319
- Were you a friend of Matt Greenwood's?
- No.

1174
01:11:31,354 --> 01:11:33,152
- A business associate?
- Of course not.

1175
01:11:33,289 --> 01:11:34,484
Huh.

1176
01:11:34,624 --> 01:11:39,085
And if I tell you that four individuals
who worked at Matt Greenwood's studio

1177
01:11:39,228 --> 01:11:42,562
identified you as the man
they saw with Mr. Greenwood

1178
01:11:42,698 --> 01:11:44,223
before the mayor was murdered...

1179
01:11:44,367 --> 01:11:45,892
I'd say you're a very
naive young lady

1180
01:11:46,035 --> 01:11:48,447
who should know better than to
believe the word of pornographers

1181
01:11:48,471 --> 01:11:50,702
before she believes
the chief of police.

1182
01:11:50,840 --> 01:11:53,639
Objection. This is nothing
but a wild goose chase

1183
01:11:53,776 --> 01:11:56,245
designed to distract
and confuse the jury.

1184
01:11:56,379 --> 01:11:58,314
I'm establishing
motive, Your Honor.

1185
01:11:58,447 --> 01:11:59,881
For whose murder?

1186
01:12:00,016 --> 01:12:03,578
Mr. Greenwood's? The
mayor's? Or Eva Brodsky's?

1187
01:12:03,719 --> 01:12:07,281
You're trying my
patience, young lady.

1188
01:12:09,559 --> 01:12:12,222
I cannot control what this
witness says, Your Honor.

1189
01:12:12,361 --> 01:12:14,990
But the court's use of the
term "young lady" to me

1190
01:12:15,131 --> 01:12:18,101
is inappropriate, demeaning,
and unprofessional.

1191
01:12:18,234 --> 01:12:20,533
I apologize.

1192
01:12:21,737 --> 01:12:24,332
Here's the deal, Ms. Mclntyre.

1193
01:12:24,473 --> 01:12:29,605
You have exactly one minute to
make this line of questioning relevant.

1194
01:12:29,745 --> 01:12:31,646
If you fail to do so,
you're out of order.

1195
01:12:31,781 --> 01:12:33,249
Understood?

1196
01:12:33,382 --> 01:12:34,611
Yes, Your Honor.

1197
01:12:37,220 --> 01:12:42,318
I am going to show you what we'll
call Defense Exhibit D for identification.

1198
01:12:44,660 --> 01:12:47,687
This is a copy of the deed
to a piece of property you own

1199
01:12:47,830 --> 01:12:51,028
outside Jacksonville,
Florida, is it not?

1200
01:12:51,167 --> 01:12:52,635
Yes, it is.

1201
01:12:52,768 --> 01:12:54,634
When did you buy it?

1202
01:12:54,770 --> 01:12:56,363
A little less than a year ago.

1203
01:12:56,505 --> 01:12:59,065
I subpoenaed your bank records,

1204
01:12:59,208 --> 01:13:04,169
and they show no indication of any transfer
of funds to purchase this property.

1205
01:13:05,948 --> 01:13:07,348
How did you pay for it?

1206
01:13:09,018 --> 01:13:11,010
I frankly don't remember.

1207
01:13:11,153 --> 01:13:12,917
Maybe your memory will improve

1208
01:13:13,055 --> 01:13:16,548
when I show you Matt
Greenwood's bank records.

1209
01:13:16,692 --> 01:13:18,024
I subpoenaed those, too.

1210
01:13:18,160 --> 01:13:21,824
If you look right here, a
little less than a year ago,

1211
01:13:21,964 --> 01:13:25,457
at exactly the same time that
piece of property was purchased,

1212
01:13:25,601 --> 01:13:29,732
Matt Greenwood withdrew $230,000
from one of his cash accounts.

1213
01:13:29,872 --> 01:13:32,068
Two hundred and
thirty thousand dollars

1214
01:13:32,208 --> 01:13:35,975
is exactly what this piece
of property cost, is it not?

1215
01:13:37,346 --> 01:13:40,125
Matt Greenwood purchased that
piece of property in your name, didn't he?

1216
01:13:40,149 --> 01:13:41,583
Objection.

1217
01:13:41,717 --> 01:13:43,117
He was paying
you off, wasn't he?

1218
01:13:43,252 --> 01:13:45,585
Time's up, Ms. Mclntyre.

1219
01:13:45,721 --> 01:13:49,749
You've succeeded in establishing
this witness' relationship

1220
01:13:49,892 --> 01:13:53,522
with everyone in this
city but Eva Brodsky.

1221
01:13:53,663 --> 01:13:57,430
And it is this court's opinion
that you have done this

1222
01:13:57,566 --> 01:14:02,903
with the sole purpose of
confusing and misleading the jury.

1223
01:14:03,039 --> 01:14:04,974
I chastise you for that

1224
01:14:05,107 --> 01:14:10,569
and am now instructing you
to move on to something else.

1225
01:14:10,713 --> 01:14:15,014
Your Honor, my client's freedom,
if not his life, is at stake here.

1226
01:14:15,151 --> 01:14:17,211
You have to grant
me a little leeway.

1227
01:14:17,353 --> 01:14:19,322
I have granted you
acres of leeway!

1228
01:14:19,455 --> 01:14:21,390
Now move on or sit down!

1229
01:14:22,558 --> 01:14:24,598
Dave Peters was shot and
killed along with the mayor

1230
01:14:24,727 --> 01:14:28,027
because he found out Matt Greenwood was
playing footsie with the chief of police.

1231
01:14:28,164 --> 01:14:29,741
- Objection!
- You're out of order.

1232
01:14:29,765 --> 01:14:30,926
That's why they were killed.

1233
01:14:31,067 --> 01:14:32,945
One more word, and I'll
charge you with contempt.

1234
01:14:32,969 --> 01:14:36,201
Eva Brodsky was killed so that Arthur
Eller would be arrested for the murder.

1235
01:14:36,339 --> 01:14:37,363
That's one day.

1236
01:14:37,506 --> 01:14:40,340
Don't you see? They wanted him
removed from the Brodsky commission.

1237
01:14:40,476 --> 01:14:42,968
- It was a cover-up.
- Two days. Bailiff.

1238
01:14:43,112 --> 01:14:45,479
What... What is
the matter with you?

1239
01:14:45,614 --> 01:14:47,640
How can you be
so... so pig-headed?

1240
01:14:47,783 --> 01:14:49,046
That's three days!

1241
01:15:16,912 --> 01:15:18,073
Hi.

1242
01:15:19,915 --> 01:15:22,077
I don't feel like talking, okay?

1243
01:15:23,519 --> 01:15:25,044
You lost it in there.

1244
01:15:25,187 --> 01:15:27,554
I made an ass out of myself.

1245
01:15:27,690 --> 01:15:31,559
Well, that just shows you care.

1246
01:15:31,694 --> 01:15:33,595
There's nothing
wrong with caring.

1247
01:15:33,729 --> 01:15:36,392
Caring can kill you, Dad.

1248
01:15:43,072 --> 01:15:46,372
Leigh Anne, you said...

1249
01:15:47,676 --> 01:15:49,645
we've grown apart.

1250
01:15:50,813 --> 01:15:54,978
Is there some way
we can grow together?

1251
01:15:58,120 --> 01:15:59,611
I don't know.

1252
01:16:03,626 --> 01:16:05,060
Is there something...

1253
01:16:05,194 --> 01:16:07,074
Is there something more
to this than you and me?

1254
01:16:16,605 --> 01:16:18,130
Peter left me, Dad.

1255
01:16:20,643 --> 01:16:22,475
I never liked him.

1256
01:16:22,611 --> 01:16:25,547
I know.

1257
01:16:25,681 --> 01:16:27,809
Why did he leave you?

1258
01:16:27,950 --> 01:16:31,250
For somebody younger
and probably a lot prettier.

1259
01:16:33,956 --> 01:16:35,515
You still want him?

1260
01:16:35,658 --> 01:16:36,921
I don't know.

1261
01:16:37,059 --> 01:16:39,893
I loved the minute I saw
him, and now I don't know.

1262
01:16:42,164 --> 01:16:47,125
Remember, all people can fall
out of love... Husbands and wives.

1263
01:16:49,472 --> 01:16:50,565
He's a bum.

1264
01:16:50,706 --> 01:16:54,575
No. He's a nice guy who's
making a fool of himself

1265
01:16:54,710 --> 01:16:58,374
because his hair is getting gray and
he'll never make the Supreme Court.

1266
01:16:58,514 --> 01:17:00,346
And she makes him feel young.

1267
01:17:03,319 --> 01:17:06,221
You're sure more
understanding than I'd be.

1268
01:17:06,355 --> 01:17:07,983
Yeah.

1269
01:17:08,124 --> 01:17:12,084
And here I am. I've lost my
husband. I don't have any children.

1270
01:17:12,228 --> 01:17:14,060
I've pretty much failed.

1271
01:17:14,196 --> 01:17:15,687
Oh, no.

1272
01:17:15,831 --> 01:17:18,130
No, you're a fine lawyer.

1273
01:17:18,267 --> 01:17:20,896
An attractive, strong woman.

1274
01:17:27,810 --> 01:17:29,176
Strong's good?

1275
01:17:29,311 --> 01:17:30,836
Yeah.

1276
01:17:30,980 --> 01:17:33,814
Oh yeah, strong's good.

1277
01:17:37,686 --> 01:17:39,052
You know, Dad...

1278
01:17:40,756 --> 01:17:45,057
I took this case because I think
the man is innocent of the crime.

1279
01:17:47,997 --> 01:17:52,662
But really, I wanted a reason
to stay home for a while.

1280
01:17:55,304 --> 01:17:56,431
You did?

1281
01:17:57,439 --> 01:17:58,930
Yeah, I did.

1282
01:18:01,243 --> 01:18:03,144
I was looking for
something, Dad.

1283
01:18:04,780 --> 01:18:06,510
I was looking for you.

1284
01:18:14,156 --> 01:18:15,818
You found me.

1285
01:18:24,500 --> 01:18:26,366
So what should I do?

1286
01:18:28,671 --> 01:18:33,336
Well, right now you
have to stay here.

1287
01:18:34,510 --> 01:18:38,914
So rest up, sort things out.

1288
01:18:42,051 --> 01:18:44,953
Let me look after you

1289
01:18:45,087 --> 01:18:50,993
like you'd look after me if
I were having a bad time.

1290
01:19:05,374 --> 01:19:07,206
Understood, Dad.

1291
01:19:11,180 --> 01:19:13,172
I love you, Leigh Anne.

1292
01:19:27,463 --> 01:19:32,094
Your Honor, my daughter has asked that
I apologize to the court on her behalf.

1293
01:19:32,234 --> 01:19:33,395
So noted.

1294
01:19:33,535 --> 01:19:35,094
And with the court's permission,

1295
01:19:35,237 --> 01:19:37,502
she has asked and
the defendant has asked

1296
01:19:37,640 --> 01:19:39,905
that I continue with
the defense of this case.

1297
01:19:40,042 --> 01:19:42,136
Is that all right with
you, Judge Eller?

1298
01:19:42,278 --> 01:19:43,541
Yes, Your Honor.

1299
01:19:43,679 --> 01:19:46,706
Okay, Mr. Matlock.
What are we doing?

1300
01:19:46,849 --> 01:19:51,947
The defense will continue with the
examination of Police Chief Colin Young.

1301
01:19:52,087 --> 01:19:54,147
I trust you'll make no attempt

1302
01:19:54,290 --> 01:19:58,193
to pursue your daughter's ill-fated
line of questioning, Mr. Matlock.

1303
01:19:58,327 --> 01:20:00,421
Oh, my goodness, no.

1304
01:20:01,430 --> 01:20:04,264
Chief Young, come
forward and take the stand.

1305
01:20:09,672 --> 01:20:11,470
The state contends

1306
01:20:11,607 --> 01:20:17,774
that because my client was at the Brodsky
residence the evening Eva was poisoned

1307
01:20:17,913 --> 01:20:19,643
that he poisoned her.

1308
01:20:19,782 --> 01:20:24,686
But you were also seen
at that residence that night,

1309
01:20:24,820 --> 01:20:27,255
and you left
after my client did.

1310
01:20:27,389 --> 01:20:30,257
What were you doing
there, Chief Young?

1311
01:20:30,392 --> 01:20:36,160
I... stopped by to see Leo.

1312
01:20:36,298 --> 01:20:41,532
I knocked, but nobody
answered, so I left.

1313
01:20:41,670 --> 01:20:42,899
I never went inside.

1314
01:20:43,038 --> 01:20:47,635
How come you didn't tell any
of the investigating officers this?

1315
01:20:47,776 --> 01:20:50,803
Because it wasn't,
and still isn't, relevant.

1316
01:20:50,946 --> 01:20:53,609
If you weren't at the Brodsky
residence, where were you?

1317
01:20:53,749 --> 01:20:58,517
I went back to my office, worked,
watched the evening news like I always do,

1318
01:20:58,654 --> 01:21:02,182
and got home sometime after 7.

1319
01:21:02,324 --> 01:21:03,656
Uh-huh.

1320
01:21:04,960 --> 01:21:07,225
You went back to
your office and worked?

1321
01:21:07,363 --> 01:21:09,730
- Are you positive?
- Yes.

1322
01:21:09,865 --> 01:21:15,930
How could you, when according
to your secretary and this receipt,

1323
01:21:16,071 --> 01:21:19,803
the Clean Sweep Carpet Company

1324
01:21:19,942 --> 01:21:22,741
brought their equipment
into your office at 6:00

1325
01:21:22,878 --> 01:21:27,714
and were there, busy cleaning
your carpet till around 8:30?

1326
01:21:31,153 --> 01:21:32,917
Want to try again?

1327
01:21:34,490 --> 01:21:36,789
Those workmen are
prepared to testify

1328
01:21:36,925 --> 01:21:41,124
that you were nowhere
near your office that night.

1329
01:21:41,263 --> 01:21:47,066
When you went to see Leo and he
wasn't home, Eva was, wasn't she?

1330
01:21:47,202 --> 01:21:50,331
And you stayed just long
enough to kill her, didn't you?

1331
01:21:53,008 --> 01:21:54,067
No.

1332
01:21:57,079 --> 01:22:01,642
When nobody answered,
I went to see Judd Taylor.

1333
01:22:03,152 --> 01:22:04,450
Who's Judd Taylor?

1334
01:22:04,586 --> 01:22:07,181
A friend.

1335
01:22:13,328 --> 01:22:15,695
I reserve the right
to recall this witness.

1336
01:22:15,831 --> 01:22:18,426
The witness may step down.

1337
01:22:19,435 --> 01:22:20,767
We'll break for lunch.

1338
01:22:20,903 --> 01:22:23,930
This court is in
recess until 2 p.m.

1339
01:22:25,340 --> 01:22:31,712
Well, we've got two and a half
hours to figure out who Judd Taylor is.

1340
01:22:34,616 --> 01:22:36,312
I'll tell you who he is.

1341
01:22:36,452 --> 01:22:39,217
He's a wiretap rat. I
put him away twice.

1342
01:22:40,355 --> 01:22:41,355
Uh-oh.

1343
01:22:41,457 --> 01:22:46,157
In fact, Chief Young probably
paid Judd Taylor to give him an alibi.

1344
01:22:46,295 --> 01:22:47,661
No.

1345
01:22:47,796 --> 01:22:49,890
No, if he was going to pay,

1346
01:22:50,032 --> 01:22:54,333
he would have found somebody of
some consequence, not an ex-con.

1347
01:22:54,470 --> 01:22:58,100
You can bet Judd
Taylor is his alibi.

1348
01:22:58,240 --> 01:23:00,766
It doesn't look good, cowboy.

1349
01:23:13,956 --> 01:23:18,018
Well, how do you know that Colin
Young didn't go to Eva's, kill her,

1350
01:23:18,160 --> 01:23:20,755
and then go to see
his friend Judd Taylor?

1351
01:23:20,896 --> 01:23:24,094
Because Judd Taylor said
they were together from 7 to 9.

1352
01:23:24,233 --> 01:23:25,410
And you're going to believe him?

1353
01:23:25,434 --> 01:23:28,632
Arthur, proof... you know that.

1354
01:23:28,770 --> 01:23:31,899
Until we have proof to the
contrary, we've got to believe him.

1355
01:23:33,775 --> 01:23:36,108
You've got some
nice stuff in here.

1356
01:23:36,245 --> 01:23:38,737
- Thank you very much.
- Huh.

1357
01:23:38,881 --> 01:23:42,943
Well, if you didn't kill Eva,

1358
01:23:43,085 --> 01:23:45,884
then whoever did had to have
planted that poison in here.

1359
01:23:46,021 --> 01:23:50,117
I keep this place locked up tight,
day and night, even when I go out back.

1360
01:23:50,259 --> 01:23:51,818
And will you stop accusing me?

1361
01:23:51,960 --> 01:23:54,327
- I'm not accusing you.
- Yeah, you are.

1362
01:23:55,664 --> 01:23:57,257
Do you have an alarm system?

1363
01:23:57,399 --> 01:23:59,698
No. But the police didn't
find any signs of forced entry.

1364
01:23:59,835 --> 01:24:03,363
Well, somebody had
to get in here some way.

1365
01:24:10,078 --> 01:24:15,984
You were the first person to be
accused of your wife's murder,

1366
01:24:16,118 --> 01:24:17,381
is that correct, Mr. Brodsky?

1367
01:24:17,519 --> 01:24:18,543
Yes.

1368
01:24:18,687 --> 01:24:21,589
Would you please explain to
the court how that happened?

1369
01:24:23,559 --> 01:24:27,189
Well, about a week
before her death,

1370
01:24:27,329 --> 01:24:30,094
I began to suspect that
she was cheating on me,

1371
01:24:30,232 --> 01:24:33,396
so I hired a private
investigator to look into it.

1372
01:24:33,535 --> 01:24:36,266
And when he showed
me the pictures of my wife

1373
01:24:36,405 --> 01:24:40,240
entering a motel room with
Arthur Eller, well, I just went crazy.

1374
01:24:40,375 --> 01:24:46,542
I went home, I got my gun, and in a fit
of rage, I shot her while she was sleeping.

1375
01:24:46,682 --> 01:24:48,548
At least I thought
she was sleeping.

1376
01:24:48,684 --> 01:24:51,882
When the police discovered
that she had been poisoned

1377
01:24:52,020 --> 01:24:54,353
and had died long
before I shot her,

1378
01:24:54,489 --> 01:24:58,017
they released me and
arrested Arthur Eller.

1379
01:24:58,160 --> 01:25:01,255
And before that night,

1380
01:25:01,396 --> 01:25:05,060
you had no idea your wife was
having an affair with my client?

1381
01:25:05,200 --> 01:25:06,691
No. I had no idea.

1382
01:25:06,835 --> 01:25:12,297
So up until then, you had
a normal, happy marriage?

1383
01:25:12,441 --> 01:25:13,704
Yes, that's right.

1384
01:25:13,842 --> 01:25:16,505
Well, would you explain

1385
01:25:16,645 --> 01:25:20,741
why the lady who comes in to
clean your house, Margo Church,

1386
01:25:20,882 --> 01:25:26,219
is ready to testify that three
months before your wife died,

1387
01:25:26,355 --> 01:25:30,122
you had pretty well taken up
residence in the guest room?

1388
01:25:34,096 --> 01:25:38,659
Is that the way people act in
a normal, healthy marriage?

1389
01:25:41,236 --> 01:25:42,898
Uh, no. But...

1390
01:25:43,038 --> 01:25:46,702
You knew about the affair
all that time, didn't you?

1391
01:25:46,842 --> 01:25:48,242
For all that three months?

1392
01:25:48,377 --> 01:25:49,377
No.

1393
01:25:49,511 --> 01:25:50,809
But you didn't do anything

1394
01:25:50,946 --> 01:25:57,250
until you realized your wife
knew something about you

1395
01:25:57,386 --> 01:25:59,321
that could very well ruin you.

1396
01:26:02,891 --> 01:26:08,762
And so you pretended
to shoot her in a fit of rage

1397
01:26:08,897 --> 01:26:11,560
and framed Arthur Eller

1398
01:26:11,700 --> 01:26:14,067
so that no one
would ever suspect

1399
01:26:14,202 --> 01:26:18,867
that you had already
murdered her with cyanide.

1400
01:26:19,007 --> 01:26:20,441
That's not true.

1401
01:26:20,575 --> 01:26:24,171
Your Honor, at this time, as
we discussed in chambers,

1402
01:26:24,312 --> 01:26:27,771
I'd like to show the tape of
the mayor's assassination.

1403
01:26:27,916 --> 01:26:28,916
Very well.

1404
01:26:28,984 --> 01:26:31,283
Thank you.

1405
01:26:31,420 --> 01:26:34,219
Okay. Go.

1406
01:26:35,524 --> 01:26:42,328
Now, this tape was made by Dwight
Hutchinson at the Shun Lee Cafe.

1407
01:26:44,666 --> 01:26:50,333
There was something on this tape
that I don't think has been notice before.

1408
01:26:50,472 --> 01:26:52,270
See there?

1409
01:26:52,407 --> 01:26:54,535
The mayor's down.

1410
01:26:54,676 --> 01:26:56,042
Yeah.

1411
01:26:56,178 --> 01:26:59,410
There's the other fellow,
people milling around.

1412
01:26:59,548 --> 01:27:01,346
And there's a cop.

1413
01:27:01,483 --> 01:27:02,727
Now, wait a minute,
wait a minute.

1414
01:27:02,751 --> 01:27:05,482
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait,
wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

1415
01:27:05,620 --> 01:27:07,179
<i>- Hey, it's a gun!</i>
- Now watch this.

1416
01:27:07,322 --> 01:27:08,187
<i>- He's got a gun!</i>
- Watch this.

1417
01:27:08,323 --> 01:27:10,724
<i>- The guy's over here!</i>
- The cop's got him. See?

1418
01:27:12,160 --> 01:27:13,219
Right there.

1419
01:27:13,361 --> 01:27:18,493
Right there. You see
anything unusual there?

1420
01:27:18,633 --> 01:27:20,124
No.

1421
01:27:20,268 --> 01:27:23,761
Well, let me help you out.
We'll make it a little bigger.

1422
01:27:23,905 --> 01:27:25,396
There.

1423
01:27:25,540 --> 01:27:27,236
Do you recognize that woman?

1424
01:27:27,375 --> 01:27:29,037
No.

1425
01:27:29,177 --> 01:27:31,009
How about now?

1426
01:27:38,186 --> 01:27:42,282
That's your wife,
Eva Brodsky, isn't it?

1427
01:27:48,864 --> 01:27:54,167
Somehow, she found out
about the mayor's assassination.

1428
01:27:54,302 --> 01:27:58,831
Why she didn't tell my client
you were a part of it, I don't know.

1429
01:27:59,908 --> 01:28:02,605
- This is a complete fabrication.
- Oh, no, it's not.

1430
01:28:02,744 --> 01:28:07,705
My daughter believes
that you killed Eva Brodsky

1431
01:28:07,849 --> 01:28:12,116
and framed Judge Eller to
get him off your commission.

1432
01:28:12,254 --> 01:28:14,655
But you had a much
deeper problem.

1433
01:28:14,790 --> 01:28:19,592
Your wife knew that you
were part of that assassination.

1434
01:28:19,728 --> 01:28:21,219
Maybe she didn't have any proof.

1435
01:28:21,363 --> 01:28:23,127
Maybe that's why
she didn't tell my client.

1436
01:28:23,265 --> 01:28:25,666
But she got it.

1437
01:28:26,802 --> 01:28:33,106
She made, about a week before
she died, several phone calls.

1438
01:28:33,241 --> 01:28:35,073
There's your phone bill.

1439
01:28:35,210 --> 01:28:39,580
And some of those calls were
made to Hilton Head, South Carolina,

1440
01:28:39,714 --> 01:28:43,412
where you bought that nice
condominium and big yacht last year.

1441
01:28:43,552 --> 01:28:45,316
I believe you paid cash for it.

1442
01:28:45,453 --> 01:28:48,252
Yes. Last year was a
particularly good year for me.

1443
01:28:48,390 --> 01:28:54,728
She also called the county
tax collector down there,

1444
01:28:54,863 --> 01:28:59,301
and he sent her a copy
of his copy of the check

1445
01:28:59,434 --> 01:29:01,801
that was used to
pay your property tax.

1446
01:29:01,937 --> 01:29:03,030
He sent me a copy, too.

1447
01:29:03,171 --> 01:29:05,640
Will you please
read to the court

1448
01:29:05,774 --> 01:29:10,644
the name of the man whose
signature appears at the bottom?

1449
01:29:10,779 --> 01:29:12,372
Matt Greenwood.

1450
01:29:12,514 --> 01:29:13,846
Matt Greenwood.

1451
01:29:13,982 --> 01:29:19,353
Matt Greenwood was paying you
and Police Chief Colin Young off.

1452
01:29:19,487 --> 01:29:20,546
No.

1453
01:29:20,689 --> 01:29:25,753
You were protecting him and his
porno ring and his use of minors.

1454
01:29:25,894 --> 01:29:29,695
If the mayor ever found
out, you would be ruined.

1455
01:29:29,831 --> 01:29:33,131
Not one word of this is true.

1456
01:29:33,268 --> 01:29:34,998
The problem you had
was to get the police

1457
01:29:35,136 --> 01:29:41,076
to believe my client had poisoned your
wife and to get the cyanide into his house.

1458
01:29:41,209 --> 01:29:43,007
The first part was easy.

1459
01:29:43,144 --> 01:29:44,737
You just went in the kitchen,

1460
01:29:44,880 --> 01:29:48,248
found a cup he had been using
after one of their rendezvous,

1461
01:29:48,383 --> 01:29:50,249
and put it where the
police could find it.

1462
01:29:50,385 --> 01:29:52,650
The second part was easy, too.

1463
01:29:56,191 --> 01:30:01,528
All you had to do was
find your wife's key ring

1464
01:30:01,663 --> 01:30:07,796
and use the key my client
had given her to his house.

1465
01:30:07,936 --> 01:30:09,837
I did not.

1466
01:30:09,971 --> 01:30:12,065
This is your wife's
key ring, isn't it?

1467
01:30:13,575 --> 01:30:14,575
Yes.

1468
01:30:14,643 --> 01:30:17,875
At this point, I'd like this
key ring entered into evidence

1469
01:30:18,013 --> 01:30:23,611
because this key
to my client's house

1470
01:30:23,752 --> 01:30:27,848
has two perfect fingerprints

1471
01:30:27,989 --> 01:30:32,051
obviously placed there by
the last person to use it...

1472
01:30:32,193 --> 01:30:34,594
A thumbprint and the forefinger.

1473
01:30:34,729 --> 01:30:40,566
And the person to whom
those fingerprints belong is you.

1474
01:31:02,290 --> 01:31:04,020
This court is now in session.

1475
01:31:04,159 --> 01:31:06,321
The Honorable
Michael Alden presiding.

1476
01:31:08,063 --> 01:31:09,964
Dad, good luck.

1477
01:31:10,098 --> 01:31:11,999
- Come on up here.
- No, no. It's your case.

1478
01:31:12,133 --> 01:31:14,093
I need somebody up here
prettier than me. Come on.

1479
01:31:14,202 --> 01:31:15,693
Has the jury reached a verdict?

1480
01:31:16,972 --> 01:31:18,440
We have, Your Honor.

1481
01:31:18,573 --> 01:31:20,667
We find the
defendant not guilty.

1482
01:31:20,809 --> 01:31:23,335
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.

1483
01:31:23,478 --> 01:31:25,379
You're excused.

1484
01:31:25,513 --> 01:31:26,674
This court is adjourned.

1485
01:31:28,683 --> 01:31:31,050
Well, what can I say?

1486
01:31:31,186 --> 01:31:33,052
If there's anything I can do...

1487
01:31:33,188 --> 01:31:38,422
As a matter of fact, you can
pay my daughter $150,000,

1488
01:31:38,560 --> 01:31:41,462
hang up your spurs,
and get off the bench.

1489
01:31:42,831 --> 01:31:44,026
Nice job.

1490
01:31:44,165 --> 01:31:45,997
- Nice job.
- Thank you.

1491
01:31:46,134 --> 01:31:48,694
I usually only have to
say that to one Matlock.

1492
01:31:48,837 --> 01:31:51,636
I don't know if I can take this.

1493
01:31:51,773 --> 01:31:55,175
Julie, if you're not doing anything
later, why don't you come over to Dad's?

1494
01:31:55,310 --> 01:31:57,575
Conrad, Michelle,
you'll both come too.

1495
01:31:57,712 --> 01:31:58,712
I'm cooking dinner.

1496
01:31:58,847 --> 01:32:00,727
You don't have to do
that. We could just go out.

1497
01:32:00,849 --> 01:32:05,287
No, I want to be with my dad at
his house and have his friends over.

9999
00:00:0,500 --> 00:00:2,00
